  </table></div>
  <div class="cb tip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="18" height="18"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg><div><strong>Consolidate to save money</strong><p>Store multiple items in the USFans warehouse (free for 90 days) and ship them together. One DHL parcel with 3 items is far cheaper than three separate shipments.</p></div></div>
  <h2 class="ph">FAQ</h2>
  <div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage"><div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">How long does USFans take to ship?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Domestic freight (seller &rarr; warehouse) takes 3&ndash;7 days. International: DHL 5&ndash;10 days, EMS 10&ndash;20 days, economy lines 20&ndash;45 days depending on destination.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">How much does USFans shipping cost?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">A 700g parcel to the USA costs approximately $11&ndash;16 via economy, $24 via EMS or $38 via DHL. Use the free calculator above for an instant estimate.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">Does USFans ship to the USA?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Yes. USFans ships to the USA via DHL (5&ndash;8 days), EMS (10&ndash;18 days) and multiple economy lines (15&ndash;40 days).</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">What is domestic freight on USFans?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Domestic freight is the fee to ship your item from the Chinese seller to USFans&rsquo;s warehouse. Typically $0.70&ndash;3.50 USD, paid at checkout separately from international shipping.</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
  <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')toggleFaq(this)" itemprop="name">How can I reduce USFans shipping costs?
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-a" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">Consolidate multiple items into one shipment, use economy lines for non-urgent orders, request rehearsal packaging to reduce volumetric weight, and watch for seasonal shipping promotions.</div>
  </div>
</div></div>
</main>
